{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_122_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，公子遂如齊，至黃乃復。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"乃者，亡乎人之辭也。復者，事畢也，不專公命也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"三、辛巳，有事於大廟。仲遂卒於垂。壬午，猶繹。萬入，去籥。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"為若反命而後卒也。此公子也，其曰仲何也？疏之也。何為疏之也？是不卒者也。不疏則無用見其不卒也。則其卒之何也？以譏乎宣也。其譏乎宣何也？聞大夫之喪，則去樂卒事。猶者，可以已之辭也。繹者，祭之旦日之享賓也。以其為之變，譏之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"四、戊子，夫人熊氏薨。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"五、晉師、白狄伐秦。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"六、楚人滅舒鄝。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"七、秋，七月，甲子，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"八、冬，十月，己丑，葬我小君頃熊。雨，不克葬。庚寅，日中而克葬。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"葬既有日，不為雨止，禮也。雨不克葬，喪不以制也。而，緩辭也。足乎日之辭也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"九、城平陽。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_122_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_122","textTraditional":"十、楚師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}